cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the associated AppliedMath article and this software release."
title: "AppliedMath LexFlow: Deterministic Lexicographic Flow Allocation on Lossy Capacitated Trees"
abstract: >-
  Exact, reproducible software for deterministic lexicographic flow allocation on
  lossy, capacitated rooted trees, and for the inverse rehabilitation-design
  problem posed on the same model: the closed-form minimum-cost widening plan and
  its budget function, the epsilon-bottleneck-set ascent for lining, exact-rational
  relief sets and minimum-cost transversals, six benchmark instances including a
  36-node, 16-period controlled canal scenario, and the scripts that regenerate the
  published tables and figures. The loss operator, the closed-form Stage-1 value and the acceptance gates are evaluated in exact rational arithmetic; the Stage-2 and Stage-3 linear programs are solved in double precision.
type: software
